0e7a9692367e70493f712d0e7237c8c4e27da7886ea4134b342fddffeeb89e08; the piano modes, the rate-group registers, the off sequence).
Project-SunUEFI (per-file licences; its docs and its GPL-2.0 Linux patches read for facts only): docs/devel/hardware/oem-refresh.md,
display-resume.md, display-depth.md, docs/archive/display-clock/piano-display-smmu-observer.md (0x800 -> bank 2 under UEFI),
patches/linux/7.3/0002-display.patch (the seamless VFP update: the DSI timing double buffer, INTF_VSYNC_PERIOD_F0).

Data: the piano boot DT (out/inputs/piano-boot.dtb, sha256 50636effb5f54306ec0ab9a3061cd163d7f003d8797e04585a33205918856840): every
block address, the MDSS interrupt and its children, the SMMU streams, the splash region and the boot framebuffer's DDR vote. The stock
panel XML (unixnu-research/piano-uefi/uefi/Binaries/piano/RawFiles/Panel_P81_42_02_0a_dualdsi_dsc_vid.xml, sha256
64bb1cd81a9b4c669377aea9128e3d4c0fe8cd8abf66a7353253d379f7faa099; proprietary stock firmware data, read for its timing and command
facts only, not redistributed): the per-link timing, the link rate, DSC, the term sequence.

Not read and not used for anything: any Qualcomm or Xiaomi binary (the DPU/DSI firmware paths of ABL, the display DXEs), the
calibration and demura data, Unixnu-SM8750-Piano (GPL-3.0).
